{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Snake, you\u2019re not just guiding a hungry serpent \u2014 you\u2019re testing your brain, too.</strong><br>Every move matters, and each level challenges you to plan smartly instead of simply reacting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clever puzzle levels:\u00a0</strong>Find the right path through intricate arenas filled with switches, gates, traps, and teleporters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic gameplay with a modern twist:\u00a0</strong>Grow, turn, survive \u2014 but this time with purpose and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tricky mechanics:\u00a0</strong>Activate platforms, push blocks, solve switch puzzles \u2014 and make sure you don\u2019t trap yourself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-down perspective:\u00a0</strong>A heartfelt homage to the original, reimagined with modern effects and smooth animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric soundtrack:\u00a0</strong>Relaxing or intense \u2014 depending on how you play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you master every level without getting tangled in your own tail?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135020?t=1769165822","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135020/9c49e9a891b321c16a1a9e392cc65900c167784d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769165822","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135020/87b0dd8b05a9ab3ffaf2d1fa0516167ff25cf9fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769165822","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135020/87b0dd8b05a9ab3ffaf2d1fa0516167ff25cf9fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769165822","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},